9,Do,"1. Hit the cow by performing a Do action while facing it to acquire its meat and earn the “Eat Cow” achievement.  
2. Walk north twice to reach the water source, then Do again to drink and collect a sampling sample, fulfilling “Collect Drink” and “Collect Sampling”.  
3. Move west onto the grass block and place a plant with Place Plant, satisfying that achievement.  
4. Return to the original table location (where we previously placed it) and craft a wood sword using Make Wood Sword, unlocking that achievement and giving us a weapon.  
5. Mine nearby stone blocks to obtain stone, then craft a stone pickaxe with Make Stone Pickaxe and a stone sword with Make Stone Sword.  
6. Use the stone pickaxe to mine iron ore, then craft an iron pickaxe (Make Iron Pickaxe) and an iron sword (Make Iron Sword).  
7. If desired, place the stone and later build a furnace (Place Furnace) to smelt coal and iron.  
8. Defeat a zombie and a skeleton with our swords to earn “Defeat Zombie” and “Defeat Skeleton”.  
9. Continue mining for diamond ore and collect diamond to finish the remaining achievements.  
10. Monitor health/energy; sleep when needed to keep in top condition.  
