42,Move South,"Step 1: Collect beverage
  • Do   – drink from the water in front (Collect Drink)

Step 2: Approach and eat the cow
  • Move South   – step closer to the cow (now facing south)
  • Move South
  • Do   – eat the cow (Eat Cow)

Step 3: Eat grass
  • Move West    – turn to face west
  • Do   – eat the grass (Eat Plant)

Step 4: Place and use a plant
  • Place Plant ‑ use the plant gathered from grass (Place Plant)

Step 5: Build a wooden sword
  • Make Wood Sword ‑ craft at the table (Make Wood Sword)

Step 6: Obtain stone
  • Explore outward (Move East/West/North/South as needed) until a stone block appears in view.
  • Once a stone block is in front, use the existing wood pickaxe:
      – Move to stand directly in front of the stone
      – Do ‑ mine the stone block (Collect Stone) 

Step 7: Build stone tools
  • Make Stone Pickaxe  – craft with table, wood, and stone (Make Stone Pickaxe)
  • Make Stone Sword   – craft with table, wood, and stone (Make Stone Sword)

Step 8: Mine coal and iron
  • Travel to locations where coal and iron ore are visible.
      – Use wood/stone pickaxe to mine each ore block (Collect Coal, Collect Iron)

Step 9: Construct furnace
  • Place Stone ‑ place a stone block in front of the table (Place Stone)
  • Place Furnace ‑ build a furnace (Place Furnace)

Step 10: Smelt iron
  • Place Iron ore in the furnace, add coal as fuel, and smelt into iron bars.

Step 11: Build iron tools and weapon
  • Make Iron Pickaxe   – craft with table, furnace, wood, coal, iron (Make Iron Pickaxe)
  • Make Iron Sword    – craft with table, furnace, wood, coal, iron (Make Iron Sword)

Step 12: Defeat monsters
  • Travel until a Zombie appears:
      – Move to be adjacent and facing the zombie
      – Do ‑ strike with the sword to defeat it (Defeat Zombie)
  • Travel until a Skeleton appears:
      – Move to be adjacent and facing the skeleton
      – Do ‑ strike with the sword to defeat it (Defeat Skeleton)

Step 13: Acquire diamond
  • Explore deeper or sideways until a diamond ore block appears.
      – Use stone or iron pickaxe to mine it (Collect Diamond)

Step 14: Wake up
  • Sleep ‑ rest when energy is below maximum to trigger Wake Up achievement (Wake Up)

Step 15: Verify achievements
