3. Once at the deposit, use Do to mine both iron and coal (collect both).  
4. Return to the base table (currently 1 step south of the current position) using Move South.  
5. Place Furnace in front of the table (Place Furnace).  
6. With iron ore and coal ready, smelt iron (manually described by the game engine).  
7. Craft Iron Pickaxe and Iron Sword with Make Iron Pickaxe / Make Iron Sword.  
8. Move to an area with grass: place a Plant (Place Plant), then do a Do to eat the plant to gain “Eat Plant” achievement.  
9. Search for a cow; upon encountering one, do a Do to eat it (Eat Cow).  
10. Seek and defeat a skeleton (Move toward it, Do).  
