336,Sleep,"We will first wake up by performing a Sleep action while already sleeping. Once energy is restored we will move North to the grass tile and use Do to eat the plant. That will satisfy the “Eat Plant” achievement. Next, we will use Do on the water tile to drink, achieving “Collect Drink.” We will then move east to the stone tile with our stone pickaxe to mine stone, achieving “Collect Stone” and “Place Stone” as we will then place a stone block. After obtaining stone we will return to the table and use Do on the sapling tile to harvest wood, fulfilling “Collect Wood.” We will then place a furnace in front of the table so we can smelt ore. With the furnace we will mine iron ore using the stone pickaxe to get iron, and collect coal from a nearby lump, achieving the “Collect Iron” and “Collect Coal” achievements. We will use the furnace to smelt them into iron ingots and craft an iron pickaxe, satisfying “Make Iron Pickaxe.” With the iron pickaxe we will mine the diamond ore to get a diamond, achieving “Collect Diamond.” We will then locate any cows to eat (achieving “Eat Cow”), find and defeat a zombie (achieving “Defeat Zombie” and “Collect Sampling”), and a skeleton (achieving “Defeat Skeleton”). Using the resources we will craft the remaining weapons such as the iron sword. Finally we’ll review all achievements are done.  
Step-by-step high level actions:  
1. Sleep to remain sleeping until energy full.  
2. Move North to grass tile.  
3. Do on grass.  
4. Move west to water tile.  
5. Do on water.  
6. Move east to stone tile.  
7. Do on stone (mine).  
8. Place Stone in front of table.  
9. Move back to table.  
10. Do on sapling tile.  
11. Place Furnace in front of table.  
12. Move to iron ore tile.  
13. Do on iron ore.  
14. Collect coal tile.  
15. Do on coal tile.  
16. Craft Iron Pickaxe (Make Iron Pickaxe).  
17. Mine diamond ore.  
18. Eat cow.  
19. Defeat zombie (Do).  
20. Defeat skeleton (Do).  
21. Craft remaining weapons.  
This plan will finish all 22 achievements.  
