471,Do,"Goal: Achieve every listed achievement while maintaining health and energy.  
Currently Inventory: stone 3, iron 1, wood_pickaxe, stone_pickaxe, wood_sword.  
Status: health 4/9, food 0/9, energy 6/9.  
Steps:  
1. Use Do on the plant in front – this collects plant material and consumes it for food, raising food levels (Achievement: Eat Plant).  
2. Follow with Do again to fully consume the plant, securing enough food to reach the health limit (Achievement: Collect Plant).  
3. Place a Stone block in front – triggers Get “Place Stone” achievement.  
4. Move to a flat spot and Place Table – triggers “Place Table.”  
5. Construct a Furnace adjacent to the Table – triggers “Place Furnace.”  
6. Mine more iron ore (still present in environment) using your iron pickaxe, and mine coal from an unexplored area (intentional exploration).  
7. Gather water to drink (Do in water region – “Collect Drink”).  
8. Craft an Iron Pickaxe with the Table and Furnace using the iron, coal, and wood.  
9. Harvest more stone and iron with the new pickaxe to craft an Iron Sword.  
10. Clear a nearby forest to gather wood – “Collect Wood.”  
11. Use the iron sword to defeat hostile mobs (zombies, skeletons) – triggers Defeat Zombie/Skeleton achievements.  
12. Rest when energy is low via Sleep, then Wake Up – triggers the respective achievements.  
13. Seek out a cow and use Do to eat it – “Eat Cow.”  
14. While exploring, use Do on a sampling resource (e.g., a mushroom or special item) – “Collect Sampling.”  
15. Continue mining until you find a diamond ore and mine it with the iron pickaxe – “Collect Diamond.”  
16. Other remaining tasks (if any resources or items are missing) will be completed through exploration and use of the previously constructed tools.

The plan ensures all achievements while keeping the character alive by eating plants, drafting fire, and resting.  Now proceed to the immediate next action: eating the remaining plant to increase food and health.

